Description: Provides a structured sensitivity-analysis workflow for linear
    regression when important adjustment covariates are observed only in a
    Phase-2 subsample. The development version implements naive analysis,
    complete-case analysis, fully conditional specification multiple
    imputation, joint-model multiple imputation, inverse probability
    weighting, and augmented inverse probability weighting. This package is
    under active development and has not yet been released to CRAN.
